--
-- Two parts:
--   1. GENERATED — 2,245 stops and 32 routes from HART's published GTFS
--      feed 2608.1 (valid 2026-06-07 → 2027-01-02). Produced by
--      `scripts/build-transit-sql.ts`; DO NOT EDIT BY HAND. When HART
--      publishes a new feed, re-run the script and commit its output as the
--      next migration rather than patching this one.
